# Export from dev with mapping to test, adding a referenced element, saving the list and writing the archive.
Enter                 # main menu: Export
Enter                 # dev
Enter                 # What to export? -> Select (by hand)
text:utkcst
Enter                 # open UtkCstSource
Space                 # Objects
Space                 # Source code
Down                  # skip User tasks
Space                 # Business processes
Esc
F2                    # summary
Enter                 # Check references
wait:checked (UtkCstUserTask referenced)
Down                  # Add…
Enter
Enter                 # add the preselected references
wait:after add (selection changed since the check)
Down                  # Mapping… (Check, Mapping, Save, ...)
Enter
wait:target stand
Enter                 # test (the only target besides dev)
wait:mapping list
Down                  # UtkCstSource (Done is the first item)
Enter
text:UtkCstTarget     # search
Enter
wait:mapped
Enter                 # Done
wait:summary with mapping
Down
Down                  # Save
Enter
Enter                 # default path
wait:saved (with the warning)
Enter                 # pause
Down
Down
Down                  # Export
Enter
Enter                 # default path
wait:exported (downloads again, with the warning)
Enter                 # pause
Down
Down
Down
Down
Down
Down                  # Menu
Enter
wait:main menu
Down
Down
Down
Down                  # (Language)
Enter                 # Quit
